				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">- Torre de destilación T4 (Purificación final de Etanol Grado Industrial):</p>
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">
					<sp count="2"/>* Tope F13 (producto etanol): Acetaldehído (f&lt;10&gt;_4), LK=Etanol ((1-LK4)*f&lt;10&gt;_5), HK=Agua (HK4*f&lt;10&gt;_6).</p>
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">
					<sp count="2"/>* Fondo F12 (residuo acuoso): LK=Etanol (LK4*f&lt;10&gt;_5), HK=Agua ((1-HK4)*f&lt;10&gt;_6).</p>
			</text>
		</region>
