				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">B) Tabla paramétrica para el Inciso C:</p>
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Columnas: [ beta_1,<sp count="2"/>F14 [mol/h],<sp count="2"/>F14 [kg/h],<sp count="2"/>Relación F14/F1 [mol/mol] ]</p>
			</text>
